<title>FINLAND: TALENTUM SAYS MERITA HAS 9.3 PCT.</title>
<headline>TALENTUM SAYS MERITA HAS 9.3 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish publisher Talentum Oy said in a statement on Tuesday that banking group Merita Oy's ownership stake in it was 2.05 percent of shares and 9.26 percent of votes.  </p>
<p>Merita earlier held 10.2 percent of votes and 4.2 percent of shares in Talentum, a Merita spokesman said, adding the bank had sold some Talentum B shares. He did not elaborate.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
